name><surname>Warner</surname><given-names>A.E.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The control of chick myoblast fusion by ion channels operated by prostaglandins and acetylcholine</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>106</volume><year>1988</year><fpage>1693</fpage><lpage>1702</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2453519</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Fischer-Lougheedetal2001"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fischer-Lougheed</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>J.-H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Espinos</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mordasini</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bader</surname><given-names>C.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Belin</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernheim</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Human myoblast fusion requires expression of functional inward rectifier Kir2.1 channels</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>153</volume><year>2001</year><fpage>677</fpage><lpage>685</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11352930</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Frasch1999"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frasch</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Controls in patterning and diversification of somatic muscles during <italic>Drosophila</italic> embryogenesis</article-title><source>Curr. Opin. Genet. Dev.</source><volume>9</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>522</fpage><lpage>529</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10508697</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="FraschandLeptin2000"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frasch</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Leptin</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><